title: A Promise Broken
subtitle: A bloc accuses the Caucus of breaking its word.
tags: event
view-if: pb_ready and not finale and not game_ending
priority: 3
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_senate.svg
on-arrival: pb_ready = 0

= A Promise Broken

[+ pb_leader +] of the [+ pb_name +] takes the floor with a recording of our own campaign promise: **[+ pb_what +]**. Then, [+ pb_how +]. "The Caucus asked for our votes on its word," [+ pb_leader +] says. "We will not make that mistake twice."

- @amends: Apologise in person and offer amends.
- @shrug: Circumstances changed. Say so, and move on.

@amends
subtitle: −1 political capital. Softens the blow.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {! Q.capital -= 1; Q[Q.pb_bloc + '_relation'] += 4; Q[Q.pb_bloc + '_grudge'] = Math.max(0, (Q[Q.pb_bloc + '_grudge'] || 0) - 1.5); if (Q.pb_partner) Q.coalition_dissent -= 1; !}

The Caucus's leaders spend an evening in [+ pb_leader +]'s offices. Nothing is forgiven, but something is understood.

@shrug
subtitle: No cost now. They will remember.
on-arrival: {! Q.inst_dissent += 1; !}

The Caucus explains that governing is not campaigning. The HoloNet's commentators are unimpressed.
